# GOV.UK Web log data - Content Traffic
This documentation provides an overview of the content traffic branch of the Dataform workflow for processing Fastly web log data. The content traffic workflow is designed to process and analyse web log data to provide insights into user interactions with GOV.UK content.
For more information on the bot detection workflow, see [GOV.UK Web log data - Bot detection](bot-detection/index.html).

## Dataform workflow

<div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="/images/content-fastly-pipeline.png" 
